8,Austro-Asiatic language - definition of Austro-Asiatic language by...,https://www.thefreedictionary.com/Austro-Asiatic+language,"Austro-Asiatic language - a family of languages spoken in southern and southeastern Asia. Austro-Asiatic, Munda-Mon-Khmer. natural language, tongue - a human written or spoken language used by a community; opposed to e.g. a computer language.",Bo,Austro-Asiatic
